     ssnndd__ffmm880011 — Forte Media FM801 bridge device driver

SSYYNNOOPPSSIISS
     To compile this driver into the kernel, place the following lines in your
     kernel configuration file:

           ddeevviiccee ssoouunndd
           ddeevviiccee ssnndd__ffmm880011

