DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The ssnndd__ffmm880011 bridge driver allows the generic audio driver, sound(4), to
     attach audio devices based on the Forte Media FM801 chipset.  This is a
     common chipset found in various parts used by OEM manufacturers.

HHAARRDDWWAARREE
     The ssnndd__ffmm880011 driver supports audio devices based on the following
     chipset:

     ••   Forte Media FM801

SSEEEE AALLSSOO
     sound(4)

